# Purpose

Design Tokens define every measurable visual property used throughout Aura.

All UI components must reference these tokens.

Never hardcode colors, spacing, typography, corner radius or animation values.

---

# Color System

Aura is built around a calm midnight palette.

It should feel like ambient lighting in a modern Scandinavian home.

Never pure black.

Never pure white.

